      "text": "Consider the following:\nI. If f(n) = O(g(n)) and g(n) = O(h(n)) then f(n) = Ω(h(n))\nII. The asymptotically tight upper bound for T(n) = T(n − 2) + 1 is O(log n)\nWhich of the following is correct?",
