      "text": "Give asymptotically tight Big-O bounds for the following recurrence relations. (By using Iterative substitution method)\n\\(T(n) = T(n − 2) + 1\\) if n > 2\n\\(T(n) = 1\\) if n ≤ 2",
      "type": "MCQ",
